Z||000000||stsmithgt||03-20-2001||05:47 PM||||I ran across this anti-theft device called an auto tazor.  I was wondering if anyone has use one before.  I've thought of different ways to get around it, but none were fast or inconspicuous.  Just looking for some opinions.  Besides, it might be just the thing to keep Terry from getting my wheel. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> lol   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/autotaz.jpg"> http://members.tripod.com/wwynn/at-7.html<P>||||reg||5
